  "sourceTitle": "Chicken Macaroni Salad",
  "sourceText": "Chicken Macaroni Salad\nBy: CeciliaMQ\nPublished: Tuesday, December 8, 2009 - 11:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 chicken breast, boiled and shredded\n1 box elbow macaroni, boiled and drained\n1 big can pineapple chunks, drained\n6 hard boiled eggs, cubes\n2 tablespoons relish, drained\n1 small onion, crushed (optional)\n3 cups mayonaise\n1/2 cup condensed milk (optional)\nsalt and groundpepper to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix above ingredients and chill overnight. 2 Best serve when chilled. 3 Great for snack or side dish.\n\nAbout\n\n\nFilipino style.",
